Subject: Cantor M2B Platform Preflight Forms

Description: Canonical implementation authority for strict, effect-free machine forms that distinguish Windows root-open failure, query failure, and complete platform-preflight evidence. This specification does not authorize a Windows function call, handle operation, filesystem observation, or topology scan.

